## 12. Transport

Transport is how messages and work activation move. It is not the protocol.

Supported or planned transport families:

- CLI subprocess spawn;
- CLI spawn through a visible Herdr pane;
- stdout/NDJSON frames;
- filesystem mailbox;
- MCP call;
- HTTP/API call.

